 year celebration!\n\nThe year is nearly behind us\, which means it’s tim
 e to reflect on all the fun everyone had during this year’s Community Da
 ys. If you missed any\, now’s your chance to catch up!\n\nThe last Commu
 nity Day of 2026 will take place over two days—Saturday\, December 12\, 
 2026\, and Sunday\, December 13\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local
  time.\n\nNote: The only difference between Day 1 and Day 2 are the Pokém
 on appearing more frequently in the wild.\n\nMore info: https://leekduck.c
 om/events/december-communityday2026/\n\nData from LeekDuck.com
