DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Pokémon GO: Daydream Destinations!\n\nIn Pokémon 
 GO\, Seasons are periods of time that feature new events\, Pokémon debuts
 \, and surprises that all follow a certain theme. As the Seasons change\, 
 you may find different Pokémon appearing in your area and hatching from E
 ggs. Make sure to explore during each in-game Season to collect and train 
 as many different Pokémon as you can! You’ll also enjoy special bonuses
  as you do.\n\nMore info: https://leekduck.com/events/season-25-daydream-d
 estinations/\n\nData from LeekDuck.com
